native_mirror.frames (acp.frame): every field a frame encodes

{
  "at": "2026-01-02T03:04:05.000000006Z",
  "prompt": {
    "turn": "text",
    "text": "text",
    "attachments": [
      {
        "id": "text",
        "kind": "text",
        "name": "text",
        "title": "text",
        "description": "text",
        "mimeType": "text",
        "data": "text",
        "uri": "text",
        "size": 1,
        "annotations": {
          "audience": [
            "text"
          ],
          "priority": 1.5,
          "lastModified": "text",
          "_meta": {
            "text": "any"
          }
        },
        "_meta": {
          "text": "any"
        },
        "resourceMeta": {
          "text": "any"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "update": {
    "any": "json"
  },
  "replay": true,
  "cancel": "text",
  "stop": {
    "turn": "text",
    "state": "text",
    "stopReason": "text",
    "error": "text"
  },
  "lost": true
}

`update` is the agent's session/update as go-acp encodes it.
Values stored as text (listed in internal/orchestration/testdata/layout.golden): AttachmentKind TurnState StopReason
